      "locator": "full page text",
      "label": "GamingOnLinux 报道与 Gaijin 回复",
      "quote": "Update - 10:39 UTC - Gaijin replied and simply said: \"We do not use generative AI for anything other than for Ms. Second. And even there, the choice is deliberate: we use an AI-generated voice not to cut costs, or speed up production, but because we see it as a postmodern artistic statement – an AI character quite literally speaking with an AI-generated voice\"",
